<title>USA: Allied Waste Q1 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Allied Waste Q1 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the three</p>
<p>					   months ended March 31,</p>
<p>				  Reported	  Restated</p>
<p>					1997	     1996</p>
<p> Operating Revenues	 $184,065	   $56,946</p>
<p> EBITDA			   56,508	    14,476</p>
<p> Operating Income	     31,645	     7,064</p>
<p> Net Income			5,868	     2,806</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share	     0.08		0.04</p>
<p> Weighted Average Shares    75,920	    57,302</p>
<p>NOTE: In December 30, 1996, the company closed a $1.5 billion acquisition of the solid waste division of Laidlaw Inc. On March 16, 1997 Allied sold the Canadian operations purchased in that transaction. The reported amounts for the first quarter 1997 exclude the results of the Canadian operations because during this period this asset was held for sale. The restated amounts for 1996 have been restated to reflect acquisitions made during 1996 using the pooling-of-interests method of accounting and exclude the results of operations of the Laidlaw operations, it said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
